  "Question": "At the same time in sunlight, an object 3 m tall casts a shadow 2 m long, and another object casts a shadow 5 m long. Find the height of the other object. (Unit: m)",
  "Choices": {},
  "Correct Answer": "7.5",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
